cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Markerless detection of compensatory movement: validation data and analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Repetition-level data, clinician annotations and analysis code for the
  validation of a browser-based markerless pipeline that flags five
  compensatory movement patterns during a seated lateral arm raise, evaluated
  in healthy adults against independent annotations by two clinicians.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
